elf hasn't done anything wrong—",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_226"],["bgm",""],["say","avg1_110","Planting without permission does violate regulations. However...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","010","attention",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Given how chaotic things were, the fact that you still worked so diligently is no small thing. That deserves praise, not punishment.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","002","question",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_116","Huh? Are you ... praising me...?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009","attention",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["bgm",""],["say","avg1_110","That's right, I'm praising you. Going forward, the company will do its utmost to ensure normal production order and the personal safety of its employees.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","002","happy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","I believe your work also deserves more attention and recognition.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","009","flurry",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_116","Chaos... Going forward, the company... Uh, Lady Firenze... I don't really understand...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","008","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"Tiao","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_116","Does that mean something big happened in the company recently?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","You didn't hear the sounds coming from outside while you were working?",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","017","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Explosions, fires... The commotion from that battle was quite something.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["ctl","avg1_116","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,"Tiao","Linear",1.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["se","se_070"],["say","avg1_116","W-w-what?! That happened?! In the city?!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","008","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_116","Oh, right, I did hear some \"bang\"s, \"boom\"s, and crashing noises days ago...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a","009","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_116","I just thought someone's lab had blown up again and ignored it...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","008",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Heh, how interesting. It seems you're the type who completely disappears into your own world once absorbed in work.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","003","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_110","Your name is Ridge, right? I'll remember it.",0,""],["stg",0,-200.0,null,1.2,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_116","a","009","speechless",null,null,null,null,"niunie1","Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_116","I took over a greenhouse without permission and didn't get punished. I was even encouraged...==W== I knew the rumors were wrong. Lady Firenze is obviously a wonderful person.==W== I... I should repay her kindness...",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_116","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",1.0],["goon"],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["ctl","avg1_116","a","009","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg1_116","R-right, um... Lady Firenze, I have something I want to give you!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_116","a",null,null,0.9,null,null,0.0,null,"OutQuint",1.0],["se","se_072"],["w",0.5],["stg",0